text:
This app is pathetic, even though you set the PIN, every time you open the app, it asks to type in email and password;
In this day and age, why force users to use PIN, when all other apps use Face ID !!!
What a joke 😡

I’ve been using Headspace for years,
over 2,200 minutes. It stops working in the middle of meditating so it has become unusable. No response from help
@headspace.com.
